      "observed": "The net /LED_3.3V_POWER_SW contains only LED anodes D14.2, D23.2, and D4.2; it is not connected to +3V3 or to any driver/source.",
      "expected": "A net named 3.3V LED power should be connected to +3V3, or to a controlled switched 3.3V supply, so that the LEDs can be powered and light when their cathode-side signals sink.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "/LED_3.3V_POWER_SW : D14.2(A,passive) D23.2(A,passive) D4.2(A,passive)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "D4, D14, and D23 cannot light because their anodes have no supply. The associated power/Ethernet status LEDs are effectively dead.",
      "confidence": 0.88
    },
    {
      "category": "bridged_nets",
      "components": ["U8", "U11", "U18", "U19"],
      "pins": ["U8.1", "U8.2", "U11.2", "U11.3", "U18.2", "U19.2"],
      "nets": ["TXLED", "RXLED"],
      "observed": "U11.2 (RXD, output) and U19.2 (A, input) appear on both TXLED and RXLED. TXLED also contains U8.1 (TXCAN, output), while RXLED contains U8.2 (RXCAN, input). U11.3 (TXD) and U18.2 (A) do not appear on any net.",
      "expected": "TXLED and RXLED should be separate nets: TXLED should connect U8.1/TXCAN to U11.3/TXD and to the U18 input for the TX activity LED, and RXLED should connect U8.2/RXCAN to U11.2/RXD and to the U19 input for the RX activity LED.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "TXLED : U11.2(RXD,output) U19.2(A,input) U8.1(TXCAN,output)"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "RXLED : U11.2(RXD,output) U19.2(A,input) U8.2(RXCAN,input)"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "U18, U19 (`SN74LVC1G07`) driving `TXLED`/`RXLED` nets from `U8` TXCAN/RXCAN"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "CAN0 transmit path is broken because U11 TXD is unconnected, and U8 TXCAN is shorted into the RXD/RXLED net. CAN0 communication and TX activity indication would fail or be severely corrupted.",
      "confidence": 0.82
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain clear connectivity anomalies: a 3.3V LED power net is left unpowered, and the CAN0 TX/RX LED/transceiver nets are bridged/misconnected with U11 TXD and U18 input open."
}

